"Category %s is a transit (priebežná položka), so it cannot be a non-cash "
"category."
msgstr "Kategória %s je priebežná položka, preto nemôže byť nepeňažná."

#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base.field_account_account__cssk_cash_category_in_id
msgid ""
"Category to use when money comes IN through this account, where that is a "
"different column from money going out. Leave it empty when one category "
"covers both directions."
msgstr ""
"Kategória pre peniaze PRIJATÉ cez tento účet, ak ide o iný stĺpec ako pri "
"výdavku. Nechajte prázdne, ak jedna kategória pokrýva oba smery."

