#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base.field_cssk_cash_journal_line__taxable
msgid ""
"Copied from the category when the row is generated, so that recategorising "
"later cannot silently restate a filed year."
msgstr ""
"Preberá sa z kategórie pri generovaní riadku, aby neskoršia zmena kategórie "
"potichu nezmenila už podaný rok."

#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
