#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base.field_cssk_cash_journal_line__amount_tax
msgid ""
"The VAT part of the same payment. It never reaches the income-tax base for a"
" VAT payer (SK § 21 ods. 1 písm. i), and is reported separately."
msgstr ""
"DPH z tej istej platby. U platiteľa DPH nikdy nevstupuje do základu dane z "
"príjmov (§ 21 ods. 1 písm. i ZDP) a vykazuje sa samostatne."

#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base.field_cssk_cash_journal_line__amount_classified
msgid ""
"The amount as its own column carries it: negative for a storno. This is what"
" the grid prints and what the tax return's gross columns add up."
msgstr ""
"Suma tak, ako ju nesie jej stĺpec: pri storne záporná. Toto tlačí mriežka a "
"sčítavajú hrubé stĺpce daňového priznania."

#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base.field_cssk_cash_category__country_id
msgid "The country whose statute this category comes from."
msgstr "Krajina, z ktorej predpisu kategória pochádza."

#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base.action_cssk_cash_journal_line
msgid "The denník is empty"
msgstr "Denník je prázdny"

#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base.field_cssk_cash_journal_line__ref
msgid ""
"The doklad this row came from — the payment or the statement line, as the "
"book's 'Doklad' column."
msgstr ""
"Doklad, z ktorého riadok vznikol — platba alebo riadok výpisu, ako stĺpec "
"„Doklad“ v knihe."

#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base/models/cssk_cash_journal_line.py:0
