msgstr "Zápis nemá protistranu, ku ktorej by sa peniaze dali priradiť."

#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base.field_cssk_cash_journal_line__source_move_id
msgid "The invoice, bill or entry whose category this row carries."
msgstr "Faktúra alebo zápis, ktorého kategóriu riadok nesie."

#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base.field_cssk_cash_journal_line__counter_entry
msgid ""
"The money moved against its category: a refunded sale, a refund received "
"from a supplier. The amount reduces its own column instead of appearing in "
"the opposite one — which is how POHODA and Money show a storno, and what the"
" tax return's gross príjmy/výdavky columns need."
msgstr ""
"Peniaze sa pohli proti smeru svojej kategórie: vrátená tržba, vrátená platba"
" od dodávateľa. Suma znižuje svoj vlastný stĺpec namiesto toho, aby sa "
"objavila v opačnom — tak zobrazuje storno POHODA aj Money a tak to potrebujú"
" hrubé stĺpce príjmov/výdavkov v daňovom priznaní."

#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base/models/cssk_cash_journal_line.py:0
msgid "The reconciliation chain is longer than %s hops; resolve it by hand."
msgstr "Reťazec párovania je dlhší ako %s krokov; vyriešte ho ručne."

#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base.field_cssk_cash_journal_line__needs_review
msgid ""
"The row is in the book but something about it could not be resolved. Never "
"silently dropped."
msgstr ""
"Riadok je v knihe, ale niečo na ňom sa nepodarilo určiť. Nikdy sa potichu "
"nevynechá."

#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base/models/cssk_cash_journal_line.py:0
msgid "The start date must not be after the end date."
msgstr "Dátum začiatku nesmie byť po dátume konca."

#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base/wizard/cssk_cash_journal_print.py:0
msgid ""
"There is no cash journal layout for %s. Install the country module, or print"
" the spreadsheet instead."
msgstr ""
"Pre %s neexistuje rozloženie peňažného denníka. Nainštalujte modul krajiny "
"alebo vytlačte tabuľku."

#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base/models/cssk_cash_journal_line.py:0
