msgstr "Najprv DPH, potom základ"

#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base.field_cssk_cash_journal_line__kind
msgid ""
"Which column of the book the amount is classified in. It follows the "
"category, not the direction the money moved — a refunded sale stays in its "
"sales column and reduces it."
msgstr ""
"Do ktorého stĺpca knihy suma patrí. Riadi sa kategóriou, nie smerom pohybu "
"peňazí — vrátená tržba ostáva v stĺpci tržieb a znižuje ho."

#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base.field_cssk_cash_journal_line__payment_kind
msgid "Which of the book's two money columns this row belongs to."
msgstr "Do ktorého z dvoch peňažných stĺpcov knihy riadok patrí."

#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"Which part of a part payment settles the VAT. Fix it in the internal "
"directive and keep it for the whole year."
msgstr ""
"Ktorá časť čiastočnej úhrady uhrádza DPH. Stanovte to vo vnútornej smernici "
"a dodržte celý rok."

#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base.field_cssk_cash_category__tax_return_code
msgid ""
"Which row of the personal income-tax return this category feeds — SK DPFO "
"typ B tabuľka 1, CZ Příloha č. 1. The country module sets it; the figures "
"report groups by it."
msgstr ""
"Do ktorého riadku daňového priznania fyzickej osoby kategória vstupuje — SK "
"DPFO typ B tabuľka 1, CZ Příloha č. 1. Nastavuje ho modul krajiny; podľa "
"neho sa zoskupujú údaje."

#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base.field_cssk_cash_journal_line__money_direction
msgid ""
"Which way the money actually moved. Apart from ``kind`` because the two "
"genuinely differ: a refunded sale is money going OUT of an INCOME category."
msgstr ""
"Ktorým smerom sa peniaze skutočne pohli. Oddelené od ``kind``, pretože sa "
"naozaj líšia: vrátená tržba sú peniaze ODCHÁDZAJÚCE z kategórie PRÍJMU."

#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base.field_cssk_cash_category__note
msgid ""
"Why this category exists — the statutory reference, or the internal "
"directive that defines it."
msgstr ""
"Prečo kategória existuje — ustanovenie predpisu alebo vnútorná smernica, "
"ktorá ju definuje."

#. module: l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_cssk_cash_journal_base/report/cssk_cash_journal_xlsx.py:0
msgid "yes"
msgstr "áno"
